  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "Two identical thin metal plates has charge <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> respectively such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>. The plates were brought close to each other to form a parallel plate capacitor of capacitance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math>. The potential difference between them is :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "ITo1p",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mi>C</mi></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "pTP8V",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mi>C</mi></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0vDbA",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "GDJnD",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mi>C</mi></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
